        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5050ACE, T-Knob Knob with Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ace Knob with Square Rose will fit most pre-drilled doors. It will fit doors 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Ace Knob with Square Rose is suitable for use on doors that are 1-1/4 inches to  3 inches thick. The T-Knob Knob with Square Rose is available in dummy functions with out a latch but it also comes in passage and privacy functions. Choose from a huge selection of finish color options!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Emtek Square Rose with Ace Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ace Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Length: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Grip Diamater: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-ACE-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262438\"><b>Emtek Ace Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This mix-match style knob is totally customizable. If you need a different finish combination or a different rose style, <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Studio-Brass-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354650\" width=\"600\" height=\"65\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ace Knob with Square Rose",
                "description": "The Ace Knob with Square Rose will fit most pre-drilled doors. It will fit doors 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Ace Knob with Square Rose is suitable for use on doors that are 1-1/4 inches to  3 inches thick. The T-Knob Knob with Square Rose is available in dummy functions with out a latch but it also comes in passage and privacy functions. Choose from a huge selection of finish color options!",
